# FlintTrade — terminal

> Trading UI — widget-composable workspace with FlexLayout
> Port: 5173 | Follow root `AGENTS.md` for branch, review and publication rules.
> Current versions and dependency purposes: `package.json`, root `pnpm-lock.yaml` and `docs/TECH_STACK.md`.

## Quick Commands

Run from the repository root:

```bash
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm --filter @flinttrade/terminal dev
pnpm --filter @flinttrade/terminal build
pnpm --filter @flinttrade/terminal typecheck
pnpm --filter @flinttrade/terminal exec vitest run
pnpm --filter @flinttrade/terminal exec vitest run src/path/to/file.test.ts
pnpm --filter @flinttrade/terminal exec vitest run -t "test name"
```

## Architecture
- Single React app with routes and aliases defined in `src/main.tsx`.
- FlexLayout provides the workspace on `/trade` (drag, resize, tabs and serialised models).
- Widget catalogue and count pin: `src/layout/widgetFactory.tsx` and its tests; app tools live in `src/tools/`.
- Built-in workspace presets: `src/layout/workspacePresets.ts`.
- UI components: shared design-system primitives and shadcn/ui with Radix accessibility.
- 3 canonical themes (Graphite, Midnight, Ember) with dark/light/system variants
- Path alias: `@` → `src/`

## State Architecture
| Layer | Library | What |
|-------|---------|------|
| Real-time ticks | Jotai atoms | Per-instrument LTP/quote/depth via WebSocket |
| REST cache | TanStack Query v5 | Positions, orders, holdings, funds, option chain |
| App state | Zustand v5 | Connection, layout, settings, trading aggregates, theme, skill |
| Forms | react-hook-form + zod | Order entry, settings forms |

Boundary rule: data enters through ONE path only, never duplicated across stores.

## Vite Proxy (dev mode)
- `/api` → OpenAlgo REST (port 5000)
- `/ft-api` → FlintTrade Python backend (port 5100)
- `/ws` → OpenAlgo WebSocket (port 8765)
- `api.ts` uses empty base in dev (relative paths hit proxy), full host in production

## Key Files
- `src/layout/widgetFactory.tsx` — authoritative widget registry
- `src/services/api.ts` — OpenAlgo REST client with rate limiting
- `src/services/websocket.ts` — WebSocket client (authenticate → subscribe → parse nested data)
- `src/stores/connectionStore.ts` — host/apiKey/wsUrl (reads env vars on init)

## Multi-exchange support
- 10 exchange codes: NSE, BSE, NFO, BFO, CDS, BCD, MCX, NCDEX, NSE_INDEX, BSE_INDEX
- MCX different hours (9:00-23:55), lot sizes per commodity
- CDS decimal strikes (USDINR 85.50)
- Crypto (Delta Exchange): 24/7, fractional lots, INR settlement

## Theme System
- 3 canonical themes (Graphite, Midnight, Ember) with dark/light/system variants
- 4-level surface hierarchy: Base (#0b0b0f) → Raised (#141418) → Elevated (#1c1c22) → Floating (#242430)
- Glass (backdrop-blur) only on Level 3 floating elements; everything else solid
- Fonts: Geist (headings), Inter (body), JetBrains Mono (data)
- 60+ design tokens (surfaces, borders, text, trading semantics)
- FlexLayout themed via CSS custom properties
- Density modes: comfortable (default) / compact (auto on small screens)

## Rules
- TypeScript strict — no `any` types
- shadcn/ui components — no raw HTML controls
- Every widget is a FlexLayout panel registered in widgetFactory.tsx
- Absorb from repos before writing new code
- No mock/placeholder/fake data
- Test with Playwright after UI changes
